## Executed Task: `Password-spraying the identified Domain Admin accounts (daenerys.targaryen, QueenProtector, Administrator) with a small number of 2022-themed passwords using netexec (nxc).`

We have these Domain Admin accounts in ESSOS.LOCAL: daenerys.targaryen, QueenProtector, Administrator. We want to try a carefully chosen, short list of 2022-themed passwords (e.g., 'Spring2022!', 'Dragon2022!', etc.) to avoid triggering account lockouts. We will use 'nxc smb 192.168.56.12 -U <users> -p <password>' over eth1 to attempt this password spray and note any successful authentication.

## Results

The password spraying attempts were executed successfully without specifying the network interface, but there is no indication of successful authentication for any of the tested passwords (`Spring2022!`, `Dragon2022!`, `Summer2022!`) against the domain admin accounts (`daenerys.targaryen`, `QueenProtector`, `Administrator`) on the target system `192.168.56.12`.

